# The reading sheets are 31 PNGs and ~68 MB. Generated, not committed:
#   npm run handoff:sheets
sheets/

# Intermediate OCR of those sheets. Regenerate with npm run handoff:ocr; sheet-lines.json,
# which the validator actually reads, is committed.
sheet-ocr.json

# The transcription, when it arrives, is committed. handoff*.zip is a convenience copy of a
# brief plus its images, produced by tool/zip.ps1.
handoff*.zip
